Hi list,

I just wanted to give a quick update on this problem. We fixed this
problem with the logical bounds. These should work as promised now.

Also, the reason that Todd updated and found no changes was that he
had a slightly older version of R. When updating to the newest version
of Amelia, it will go the smoothest if you use the most current
version of R.

cheers,
matt.

